## Testing & Quality Discipline

### Verification Commands
Always verify changes locally using `just`:
```bash
# Install agent skills
just setup-skills

# Run all test suites across packages
just test

# Check formatting and linting
just lint

# Auto-fix lint errors and format code
just fix

# Full validation (lint + test)
just check

# Run Farama Gymnasium API conformance check
just test-env

# Multi-seed baseline policy evaluation
just eval

# Train RL agent
just train

# Interactive human play (Raylib window)
just play
```
